{
  "description": "Enhanced boundary coverage for the 128-bit x64 MurmurHash3 digest. Pins digests for: a single character, an exactly 16-character block boundary, a 17-character input (one byte into the tail/remainder path), a 16-digit numeric string, multi-byte UTF-16 code points (accented Latin and an emoji surrogate pair), a longer ASCII sentence, a single space, a newline, and a 13-character punctuation-bearing string. These exercise both the block loop and every relevant tail-length branch deterministically.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "input": {
        "op": "hash",
        "text": "a"
      },
      "expected_output": "hash=85555565f6597889e6b53a48510e895a"
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "op": "hash",
        "text": "abcdefghijklmnop"
      },
      "expected_output": "hash=c4ca3ca3224cb7234333d695b331eb1a"
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "op": "hash",
        "text": "abcdefghijklmnopq"
      },
      "expected_output": "hash=7564747f88bda657ecda499da1110de4"
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "op": "hash",
        "text": "1234567890123456"
      },
      "expected_output": "hash=4fbe5dc5c0e32cf8c0c8e96b60c322c1"
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "op": "hash",
        "text": "héllo"
      },
      "expected_output": "hash=837db5da83f25a93324c3288bb656c59"
    },
    {
      "input": {
        "op": "hash",
        "text": "😀"
      },
      "expected_output": "hash=5f37a1540af65f7ff2a1328791ad7ed5"
    },
    {
